Z||000000||DISenchanted||01-15-2000||08:02 PM||||Ok, I'm comming up the road and some early 90's Ford Taurus come flying up behind me.  It look like he's going to rear end me so I speed up and change lanes.  He pulls up next to me and guns it.  So I figure he's trying to challenge me.  I dust him, then I change back into my original lane to make my turn.  He pulls up next to me and says "Pull over you little s*#%, you think your a tough guy?"  I continue my turn and he follows me.<P>I have to stop at the next light and he says "I said pull over you little f@#$%*, I'm gonna kick your (butt)."  This guy is in his early 50's and I'm 20, so I figure that if I had to I could take him.  But I'm getting really close to my house so I need to get rid of him.<P>I pull over and this guy jumps out of his car and pulls out a baseball bat.  That was enough for me.  I gunned it and took the corner at 45.  I speed home and sat out by my car watching it for about 10 minutes to make sure that he didn't follow me.  I have no clue what I did to this guy, He should be used to losing he drives a Taurus.<P>Ok, well I'm glad I killed his car.<BR>I'm glad he didn't kill me.<BR>And I'm glad that my fiero can take corners at 45 miles per hour.<P>Thank you,<P>DISenchanted||||reg||1
Z||000001||GT Bastard||01-15-2000||11:19 PM||||Damn, that's some krazie sh*t! You shoulda taken the licence plate or something.  It's good that you decided gun-it instead of fighting him.  I think I would be too p!ssed off to leave(which is bad.) Good thinking on your part.  ||||reg||10
Z||000002||2M4 Dale||01-15-2000||11:58 PM||||He was probably just pissed off because he had to drive a Ford and you get to drive a great old PONTIAC !!!! Maybe the Government ought to ban Fords and Ballbats. lol||||reg||6
Z||000003||Monkeyman||01-16-2000||02:09 AM||||I think I would have gotten his license plate #, too, but you did a wise thing by just going home.  You never know, maybe the moron was stoned or something.  If you had decided to fight him the least that would have happened would be some damage to your Fiero.  Besides, then he might have had the chance to get <B> your </B> plate #!  Next time someone tries to run you over, just get out of his way and wave to him/her as he/she passes.||||reg||1
Z||000004||DRH||01-16-2000||04:54 AM||||I've always heard road rage was bad in CA!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Seriously... a guy in his 50s in a Taurus was probably not trying to race you. He probably also is clueless that you were trying to race him. When you got in front and went back to your lane he probably thought you were cutting him off. <P>I doubt if calling the cops would have helped anyhow. Without witnesses it's your word against his. Although... someone with his temper might just have an outstanding warrant on some other charge...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>When Mr Taurus counts his "kills" he's probably not talking about races.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  Be CAREFUL out there... As you just found out, not everyone plays by the same rules!!!<P><p>[This message has been edited by DRH (edited 01-16-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||stsmithgt||01-17-2000||09:52 AM||||RULES? WHAT RULES? That old man's temper would have given me the hint to pull over in a highly populated parking lot.  I used a Costco parking lot once and it worked well.  The gangbangers were afraid of the crowd.||||reg||1
